## 30-second elevator pitch

Organ-on-a-chip labs image their cultures every day, and those images become datasets and digital twins. A defocused or bubble-filled frame, or a language model that invents a citation, corrupts that asset silently. Zelos is a quality gate: physics tools compute the verdict, the cause and the lab action; open literature is cited; and a deterministic gate blocks every claim the evidence cannot support. It blocked {{gate.caught}} injected fabrications, it runs on a CPU in {{e9.inspect_p50}} ms, and it tells you where it fails.

